    "battery_kwh": "Usable pack size where published, otherwise the figure the app previously used.",
    "eff_km_kwh": "Mixed-cycle efficiency, km/kWh. Used by ev_solar_calculator.html.",
    "charging": "Highway/DC-fast parameters. Used by speed_vs_range.html.",
    "charging.wh_mi": "Highway baseline consumption, Wh/mile. Deliberately independent of eff_km_kwh (highway vs mixed cycle) - both are stored, neither is derived.",
