    "charging.est": "true = platform estimate, not a published per-variant figure. Treat as indicative.",
    "custom": "Manual-entry placeholder row; carries no real vehicle data and no charging block.",
    "curves": "DC charge curves as data. steps = ordered [soc_below, kW] pairs, first match wins; tail = kW at and above the last threshold. Add a platform here rather than editing the app JS.",
    "curves.est": "true = curve shape is an estimate anchored to the published peak kW and 10-80% time in its note.",
    "legacy_index_order": "The original 43-entry array order. Used once, to migrate a saved vehicleIdx from before ids were used as option values. Do not extend or reorder."
